---
title: "registerNewMember (stem-system: Member Registration)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: supabase.auth.getUser()
    q_auth --> q_no_auth: no user
    q_auth --> q_check_existing: user present
    q_no_auth --> [*]: return error (login required)
    q_check_existing --> q_query_existing: select member where user_id and deleted_at is null
    q_query_existing --> q_already: member exists
    q_query_existing --> q_validate: no existing member
    q_already --> [*]: return error (already registered)
    q_validate --> q_parse: registerSchema.safeParse(values)
    q_parse --> q_invalid: parse failed
    q_parse --> q_calc_gen: parse success
    q_invalid --> [*]: return first field error
    q_calc_gen --> q_check_status: status == 2 (OB/OG)?
    q_check_status --> q_direct_gen: OB/OG, use directGeneration
    q_check_status --> q_compute_gen: student, calculateGeneration(status, grade, academicYear)
    q_direct_gen --> q_check_gen: generation resolved?
    q_compute_gen --> q_check_gen: generation resolved?
    q_check_gen --> q_gen_null: null
    q_check_gen --> q_ensure_role: not null
    q_gen_null --> [*]: return error (cannot calculate generation)
    q_ensure_role --> q_ensure: ensureGenerationRoleExists(generation)
    q_ensure --> q_insert: insert member record (user_id, discord_uid, status, generation, etc.)
    q_insert --> q_insert_err: insert error
    q_insert --> q_update_meta: success
    q_insert_err --> [*]: return error (creation failed)
    q_update_meta --> q_admin_update: adminClient.auth.admin.updateUserById (set name in metadata)
    q_admin_update --> q_teams: insert member_team_relations (if team_ids provided)
    q_teams --> q_sync_nick: syncDiscordNickname(discord_uid, fullName)
    q_sync_nick --> q_sync_roles: syncDiscordRoles(discord_uid)
    q_sync_roles --> q_revalidate: revalidatePath(/dashboard, /dashboard/admin/members)
    q_revalidate --> [*]: return success

    note right of q_compute_gen
        INV-001: generation = 10 + (academicYear - 2025) - grade + 1 for HS
        INV-002: generation = 10 + (academicYear - 2025) + 4 - grade for JHS
        INV-003: academicYear starts in April (month >= 3)
    end note

    note right of q_validate
        INV-004: grade is required for status 0 (JHS) and 1 (HS)
        INV-005: generation is required for status 2 (OB/OG)
        INV-006: student_number must be numeric digits only
    end note
